\"","n":{"wHWoh7pfzloQdF43WOGRxA,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"wHWoh7pfzloQdF43WOGRxA","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["y4UuQb9o_hEZ",1],"o":"start","l":30,"c":"Vouching and Flagging projects"},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"18a3ab28-d48c-8047-acc5-eaafe58c5fce":{"value":{"value":{"id":"18a3ab28-d48c-8047-acc5-eaafe58c5fce","version":3,"type":"text","properties":{"title":[["When you vouch for a project, you are saying that you know this project and that you trust it. When you belong to a \"Atterster Group\" in a way you are lending the credibility of the Attester Group to the project you vouched for."]]},"created_time":1738182380390,"last_edited_time":1738182380404,"parent_id":"18a3ab28-d48c-8086-b6e6-dd9a890e80bd","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"ff891e0b-a285-4d6e-b9f4-87bde516d521","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"rcPP14e98MFhP9DKZZsXkQ,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"rcPP14e98MFhP9DKZZsXkQ,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"rcPP14e98MFhP9DKZZsXkQ","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["UVUomFRDegCX",1],"o":"start","l":228,"c":"When you vouch for a project, you are saying that you know this project and that you trust it. When you belong to a \"Atterster Group\" in a way you are lending the credibility of the Attester Group to the project you vouched for."},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"18a3ab28-d48c-8055-9a10-eaec6eb7bde4":{"value":{"value":{"id":"18a3ab28-d48c-8055-9a10-eaec6eb7bde4","version":3,"type":"text","properties":{"title":[["Similarily, when you flag a project, you are saying that you don't trust this project or you don't believe it is legitimate."]]},"created_time":1738182380390,"last_edited_time":1738182380404,"parent_id":"18a3ab28-d48c-8086-b6e6-dd9a890e80bd","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"ff891e0b-a285-4d6e-b9f4-87bde516d521","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"sGFEjQKGH7c_bOabhvMyug,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"sGFEjQKGH7c_bOabhvMyug,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"sGFEjQKGH7c_bOabhvMyug","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["q3tbnqYcFMJ7",1],"o":"start","l":124,"c":"Similarily, when you flag a project, you are saying that you don't trust this project or you don't believe it is legitimate."},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"18a3ab28-d48c-80ab-9053-e1856228c392":{"value":{"value":{"id":"18a3ab28-d48c-80ab-9053-e1856228c392","version":3,"type":"text","properties":{"title":[["Be aware that your address will be associated with the vouch or flag you make, and that this information is public and can be seen by anyone. You can additionally add a comment to your vouch or flag to provide more context."]]},"created_time":1738182380390,"last_edited_time":1738182380404,"parent_id":"18a3ab28-d48c-8086-b6e6-dd9a890e80bd","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"ff891e0b-a285-4d6e-b9f4-87bde516d521","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"hHvgPK15Bz1DIsR9dqkBKA,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"hHvgPK15Bz1DIsR9dqkBKA,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"hHvgPK15Bz1DIsR9dqkBKA","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["Q4cBvR4j-ETG",1],"o":"start","l":223,"c":"Be aware that your address will be associated with the vouch or flag you make, and that this information is public and can be seen by anyone. You can additionally add a comment to your vouch or flag to provide more context."},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"18a3ab28-d48c-80da-9105-e856b3db172d":{"value":{"value":{"id":"18a3ab28-d48c-80da-9105-e856b3db172d","version":3,"type":"text","properties":{"title":[["It is possible that an address could belong to multiple Attester Groups, when you create an attestation, you can choose which Attester Group you want to vouch or flag from. Each attestation made with a unique Attester Group used by the same address counts as a separate vouch or flag. You can only use one Attester Group per attestation on DeVouch."]]},"created_time":1738182380390,"last_edited_time":1738182380404,"parent_id":"18a3ab28-d48c-8086-b6e6-dd9a890e80bd","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"ff891e0b-a285-4d6e-b9f4-87bde516d521","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"bq_RmJ1q4sv_jdfQRlpmIw,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"bq_RmJ1q4sv_jdfQRlpmIw,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"bq_RmJ1q4sv_jdfQRlpmIw","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["gPTSPc8bPsPy",1],"o":"start","l":348,"c":"It is possible that an address could belong to multiple Attester Groups, when you create an attestation, you can choose which Attester Group you want to vouch or flag from. Each attestation made with a unique Attester Group used by the same address counts as a separate vouch or flag. You can only use one Attester Group per attestation on DeVouch."},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"18a3ab28-d48c-80ca-815e-c3ac08b579ab":{"value":{"value":{"id":"18a3ab28-d48c-80ca-815e-c3ac08b579ab","version":3,"type":"sub_header","properties":{"title":[["Editing Attestations"]]},"created_time":1738182380390,"last_edited_time":1738182380404,"parent_id":"18a3ab28-d48c-8086-b6e6-dd9a890e80bd","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"ff891e0b-a285-4d6e-b9f4-87bde516d521","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"hSFYGepGjLCvPNZxyAKNVQ,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"hSFYGepGjLCvPNZxyAKNVQ,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"hSFYGepGjLCvPNZxyAKNVQ","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["5G0Ouwna52wU",1],"o":"start","l":20,"c":"Editing Attestations"},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"18a3ab28-d48c-80a0-b927-f95b552ad81d":{"value":{"value":{"id":"18a3ab28-d48c-80a0-b927-f95b552ad81d","version":3,"type":"text","properties":{"title":[["You can edit your attestation, whether it was a vouch or a flag. This will allow you to change your vouch to a flag or vice versa and also write a new comment into your attestation. This will create a new on-chain attestation that will replace the old one. If you attest to the project as part of other Attester Groups, those attestations will remain unchanged."]]},"created_time":1738182380390,"last_edited_time":1738182380404,"parent_id":"18a3ab28-d48c-8086-b6e6-dd9a890e80bd","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"ff891e0b-a285-4d6e-b9f4-87bde516d521","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"D4CUETYqrgn2awUxOoL0ow,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"D4CUETYqrgn2awUxOoL0ow,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"D4CUETYqrgn2awUxOoL0ow","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["VEDdmAk9eVQJ",1],"o":"start","l":361,"c":"You can edit your attestation, whether it was a vouch or a flag. This will allow you to change your vouch to a flag or vice versa and also write a new comment into your attestation. This will create a new on-chain attestation that will replace the old one. If you attest to the project as part of other Attester Groups, those attestations will remain unchanged."},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"18a3ab28-d48c-8083-98ab-e2d3439998d8":{"value":{"value":{"id":"18a3ab28-d48c-8083-98ab-e2d3439998d8","version":3,"type":"text","properties":{"title":[["You can edit your attestations from either the project details page of the project you attested to or from the 'My Attestations' page."]]},"created_time":1738182380390,"last_edited_time":1738182380404,"parent_id":"18a3ab28-d48c-8086-b6e6-dd9a890e80bd","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"ff891e0b-a285-4d6e-b9f4-87bde516d521","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"C8kZqaX6p8Isy1QXse_FHA,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"C8kZqaX6p8Isy1QXse_FHA,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"C8kZqaX6p8Isy1QXse_FHA","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["b3VgV6iUf8mB",1],"o":"start","l":134,"c":"You can edit your attestations from either the project details page of the project you attested to or from the 'My Attestations' page."},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"18a3ab28-d48c-80a9-9364-c220677c1299":{"value":{"value":{"id":"18a3ab28-d48c-80a9-9364-c220677c1299","version":3,"type":"sub_header","properties":{"title":[["Deleting Attestations"]]},"created_time":1738182380390,"last_edited_time":1738182380404,"parent_id":"18a3ab28-d48c-80